DOCUMENTATION:
    PURPOSE: Toy SPECDATA library of whole host spectra
    USAGE_KEY: HOSTLIB_SPECDATA_FILE
    USAGE_CODE: snlc_sim.exe
    NOTES:
    - Four spectra built from fixed mixes of the 12 EAZY templates in
    - $SNDATA_ROOT/models/EAZY/SNANA_SPECBASIS_EAZY.DAT, resampled onto a
    - 10 A grid over 2000-12000 A and each scaled to a target LSST-r AB
    - magnitude (20.0, 20.8, 21.4, 22.0) so the hosts are realistically
    - bright. Galaxies select one whole spectrum via IDSPECDATA rather
    - than combining them, which is what distinguishes SPECDATA from
    - SPECBASIS. Narrow emission lines are smoothed out (80 A Gaussian):
    - unresolved on this grid they would dominate the quadrature
    - residual, which the SPECBASIS fixture already covers.
DOCUMENTATION_END:

FLAM_SCALE: 1.0
FLAM_SCALE_POWZ1: 0

